  "description": "LumasPDF is a cross-platform PDF library with pre-compiled native binaries for Windows (x64, x86, ARM64), Linux (x64, ARM64) and macOS (universal x86_64 + arm64).\n\nMain features are PDF creation and editing, PDF rendering and printing, PDF forms including dynamic XFA, digital signatures, barcodes, tables, text and image extraction, content parsing, PDF optimization, and conversion to PDF/A, PDF/X, PDF/UA, ZUGFeRD and Factur-X.\n\nThe managed assembly is a thin P/Invoke layer over the native engine and exposes the complete 1656-export C ABI.",
